      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s much easier to just use `android_bluetooth_packet_gen` rule in CMake that will do the job for us, than create the full directory structure, and keep in mind where the packetgen binary and its dependencies are (e.g. we\u0027d need to put both the binary and `libc++.so.1` in the \"bin\" subdir, and make sure we don\u0027t screw up with the target/host architecture in the process).\nSo, no, I\u0027d rather not use `generate_packets` there.",
      "parentUuid": "fe07241c_0c80746e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 21,
        "startChar": 4,
